# {{.ProjectName}}

Generated by Scaffold Agent as a Go modular-monolith service with {{.Database.DisplayName}},
browser sessions, API tokens, and security audit events.
{{if .Business}}
It also contains a generated `{{.Business.EntityName}}` CRUD module with keyset
pagination, optimistic locking, transactional audit events, and explicit RBAC.
{{end}}
{{if .Tenancy}}
It also contains the `organization-tenancy` capability. Protected business data
is scoped by organization membership and the `X-Organization-ID` request header.
{{if .TenancyLifecycle}}
Organization version `0.3.0` adds an explicit owner, atomic ownership transfer,
and reversible deactivation. Inactive organizations retain data but cannot
authorize tenant business requests.
{{end}}
{{end}}
{{if .Jobs}}
It also contains the `background-jobs` capability with idempotent enqueue,
database leases, heartbeat renewal, bounded retry, and dead-letter state.
{{end}}
{{if .Files}}
It also contains the `file-assets` capability with tenant-scoped metadata,
streaming uploads, SHA-256 integrity metadata, and atomic local object writes.
{{end}}
{{if .Cache}}
It also contains the `application-cache` capability with cross-instance database
storage, tenant-aware keys, bounded JSON values, and explicit TTL cleanup.
{{end}}
{{if .JobAdmin}}
It also contains `job-administration` with payload-free status inspection and
audited dead-job retry. Only administrators receive its permissions.
{{end}}
{{if .Observability}}
It also contains `observability` with request correlation, safe structured access
logs, low-cardinality Prometheus metrics, and bounded database readiness.
{{end}}
{{if .CSVTransfer}}
It also contains `csv-import-export` with a Blueprint-derived field contract,
atomic create-only imports, audited exports, and separate permissions.
{{end}}
{{if .Approvals}}
It also contains `approval-workflows` with tenant-scoped subject validation,
separate submitter and reviewer permissions, optimistic transitions, and immutable events.
{{end}}
{{if .Catalog}}
It also contains `commerce-catalog` with canonical SKUs, integer minor-unit
prices, audited publication, optimistic concurrency, and active-only public reads.
{{end}}
{{if .CustomerAccounts}}
It also contains `customer-accounts` with a customer-only session cookie,
scoped email identity, optimistic lifecycle management, session revocation, and
employee administration permissions that remain separate from storefront identity.
{{end}}
{{if .CRM}}
It also contains `crm-core` with business accounts, contacts, immutable
activities, and forward-only sales opportunities.
{{end}}
{{if .Inventory}}
It also contains `erp-inventory` with independent SKU and warehouse master
data, integer balances, idempotent stock commands, immutable movements,
one-way reservations, and controlled purchase receiving.
{{end}}

